# UBS Credit Risk Early Warning System (SMU IS4000)

## Architecture
Multi-agent pipeline: `intake_case → FIS → RS → SQ → SIS → FRD`

## Tech Stack
Python 3.11+, FastAPI, LangGraph, LangExtract (`google/langextract`), Gemini 2.5 Flash, Pydantic, PostgreSQL

## My Scope
SIS (Signal Intelligence Subgraph)

## Conventions
- Type hints everywhere
- Pydantic models for all data contracts
- Docstrings on public functions
